JPL'S GLOBAL IONOSPHERE MAPS YEAR 2023 DAY 153              COMMENT             
Global Ionospheric Maps (GIM) are generated on an hourly    DESCRIPTION         
and daily basis at JPL using data from up to 100 GPS sites  DESCRIPTION         
of the IGS and others institutions.                         DESCRIPTION         
The vertical TEC is modeled in a solar-geomagnetic          DESCRIPTION         
reference frame using bi-cubic splines on a spherical grid. DESCRIPTION         
A Kalman filter is used to solve simultaneously for         DESCRIPTION         
instrumental biases and VTEC on the grid (as stochastic     DESCRIPTION         
parameters).                                                DESCRIPTION         
Contact Address:  gpsiono@cobra.jpl.nasa.gov .              DESCRIPTION         
